{"id":"vod_bf_39199","vodId":"39199","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"邪神与厨二病少女","name_cn":"邪神与厨二病少女","date":"2018-01-01","year":"2018","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-40/5de64d33a84ee7005c70eb444829e859.jpg"},"summary":"花园百合铃（大森日雅 配音）是一个标准的中二少女，虽然已经升入了大学，还整日里一副哥特萝莉的打扮，虽然右眼带着眼罩，但实际上视力毫无问题。表面看来，百合铃有些古怪和难以接近，可实际上，她对待朋友非常的热情友善。一次偶然中，百合铃竟然从魔界里召唤出了恶魔邪神酱（铃木爱奈 配音），她可是那里里地位最崇高的恶魔。　　邪神酱一心想要回到魔界，而回去的唯一方法就是杀死她的召唤者百合铃，可是实际上，邪神酱是一个笨手笨脚的废柴，每当她设计想要袭击百合铃时，总是会被后者在有意无意之中一招化解。除了邪神酱外，美杜莎（久保田未梦 配音）、佩柯拉（小坂井祐莉绘 配音）等恶魔也降临人间。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-04-29 22:55:33","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/xieshenyuchuerbingshaonv/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/xieshenyuchuerbingshaonv/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/xieshenyuchuerbingshaonv/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/xieshenyuchuerbingshaonv/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/xieshenyuchuerbingshaonv/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/xieshenyuchuerbingshaonv/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/xieshenyuchuerbingshaonv/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/xieshenyuchuerbingshaonv/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/xieshenyuchuerbingshaonv/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/xieshenyuchuerbingshaonv/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/xieshenyuchuerbingshaonv/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/xieshenyuchuerbingshaonv/第12集/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:31:49.3